WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.033
Edited at https://subtitletools.com

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:08.793
The seven Dragon Balls,

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:13.548
when gathered together, will grant any wish.

00:00:13.764 --> 00:00:18.554
The Saiyan who was raised on Earth, Son Goku,

00:00:18.769 --> 00:00:22.136
has thwarted the ambitions of
one powerful foe after another

00:00:22.356 --> 00:00:26.565
as they tried to get their
hands on the Dragon Balls.

00:00:26.777 --> 00:00:32.693
And, in the thick of battle
with the space emperor Freeza...

00:00:32.908 --> 00:00:36.275
How dare you... How dare you...?!

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:45.834
...he was roused to become
a legendary Super Saiyan.

00:00:46.839 --> 00:00:49.455
You monkey!!

00:00:58.559 --> 00:01:01.767
You deserve to be killed!

00:01:02.771 --> 00:01:06.889
You dumbass!!

00:01:10.988 --> 00:01:14.697
After an intense battle,
he defeated Freeza at last,

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:17.615
and preserved the peace.

00:01:18.787 --> 00:01:23.451
Several years later, a new crisis
closed in on the Earth.

00:01:31.884 --> 00:01:36.719
It was the threat of the Artificial Humans.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:41.515
At length, a fight against
the mightiest Artificial Human,

00:01:53.405 --> 00:01:55.521
Ka... me...

00:01:55.741 --> 00:01:58.733
...ha... me...

00:02:01.997 --> 00:02:03.328
Oh, crap!

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:05.997
...Ha!!

00:02:08.295 --> 00:02:12.755
Goku put up a fierce fight against Cell...

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:15.673
You're up next, Gohan!

00:02:19.181 --> 00:02:21.046
Focusing on the future,

00:02:21.266 --> 00:02:26.056
he entrusted the battle to his son, Son Gohan.

00:02:26.271 --> 00:02:29.763
However, Gohan was faced
with an uphill battle.

00:02:30.776 --> 00:02:33.893
Come on, come on, come on, come on! Well?!

00:02:34.112 --> 00:02:36.945
If you're going to get mad,
then really blow your top!

00:02:49.044 --> 00:02:50.784
Son Gohan...

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:54.997
It is no sin to fight for what is right.

00:02:55.217 --> 00:02:58.960
There are some people
that words will not reach.

00:02:59.179 --> 00:03:03.047
Give your inner self over freely to your anger.
